MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m01_005: For a change of pace, Your Majesty, would you like\nto attend an interesting match I've heard tell of?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m01_006: Apparently, it is a private and exclusive bout,\nnot announced to the general public.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m01_007: Details are scant, but I have gleaned that the\nWhite-Maned Demon will be taking part.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m01_008: A man named Poloni, who serves as the arena's\ncommissioner, is coordinating it.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m01_009: If you are interested, it should be simple enough to\nget him to approve us as spectators.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m01_001: This exhibition match will take place on Efraul 6 at\n6:00 PM.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m01_002: If our schedule permits it, let us be sure to remember\nto visit the Crystal Palace, the venue for the match.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m01_003: The White-Maned Demon is one of the most popular\ncombatants. He is a warrior among warriors. 
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m01_004: I am certain Your Majesty will enjoy the sight of it.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_Bon_m01: <BLN>A change of pace, perhaps?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m02_001: Now then, we must ensure we are fully prepared for\nhim to strike again.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m02_002: This rabid dog cannot be allowed to run loose any\nlonger. Let us put him out of our misery.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_Bon_m02: <BLN>We must be prepared.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Tob_m01_001: Y'know...I had thought I was getting used to\nthis place.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Tob_m01_002: But I'm still craning my neck to see something wild\nevery five seconds, and it's givin' me a crick.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Tob_m01_003: And Bona's got it even worse! He spends every day\nwalking around with a big ol' frown.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Tob_m01_004: But I can't complain, so long as I can relax in the\nevenings with some good ale.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_Tob_m01: <BLN>My neck's gettin' sore.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lil_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lil_m01_001: This Bahr Vahn guy is the Har Hali chief that\nPrince Dyan sicced on you, right?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lil_m01_002: He seemed way more dangerous than when we went\nup against him in the arena...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lil_m01_003: Am I scared? Of course.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lil_m01_004: Nothing in the world is creepier than someone who\nyou can't figure out.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lil_m01_005: While I've got you here—if I get the kill on him,\nis there a bonus in it?
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_Lil_m01: <BLN>That guy scares me.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lys_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lys_m01_001: Bahr Vahn seems to have vanished from Dagsion.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lys_m01_002: I don't doubt that he's gone into hiding to recover\nhis strength.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lys_m01_003: But a man like that would be rather conspicuous,\nyou'd think...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lys_m01_004: Where could he possibly hide in this teeming city?
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_Lys_m01: <BLN>Where is he hiding?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m03_001: Every Saraminian soldier here is mobilizing to pursue\nBahr Vahn.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Bon_m03_002: Let us join them to hunt him down and end his\ncampaign of terror!
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_Bon_m03: <BLN>Let us put him down.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Tob_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Tob_m02_001: Damn it! He was right there, and I lost him. That\nguy's one slippery customer.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Tob_m02_002: He's probably long gone from here, boss. Let's go\nshake the trees and see what falls out!
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_Tob_m02: <BLN>Can't believe I lost him.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lil_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lil_m02_001: Check it out, Your Majesty. This blood trail's fresh.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lil_m02_002: No guarantees, but I'd bet he's up ahead.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_Lil_m02: <BLN>It's a good bet...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lys_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lys_m02_001: Your Majesty! We've turned up a witness.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Lys_m02_002: He can't be far. Let's drive him out of hiding!
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_Lys_m02: <BLN>The snare tightens!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Kou_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Kou_m01_001: You're sure he'll show his face at the next full moon?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Kou_m01_002: If so, I would like your help defeating him. Come find\nme on the day before, {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=Month} {DateTime=Day}{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_Kou_m01: <BLN>Bahr Vahn...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Kou_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Kou_m02_001: Tonight is the full moon at last. Will he show\nhis face?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_Kou_m02_002: If so, I would like your help defeating him. Come find\nme again once you're ready.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_Kou_m02: <BLN>Bahr Vahn...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B01_m01_001: You are Queen Theodora, yes? We are currently\nholding an exhibition match.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B01_m01_002: I was told you might attend. Would you like to watch\nthe match?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B01_m01_003: <ICA>Say yes.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B01_m01_004: <ICB>Say no.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_B01_m01: <BLN>I was told you might attend.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B02_m01_001: He got past us... Went straight into the temple...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B02_m01_002: "The temple"? You mean the temple of Yu Phas?!\nQuickly, everyone!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B03_m01_001: No sign of Bahr Vahn this way, Your Majesty.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_B03_m01: <BLN>Nothing, my queen.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B04_m01_001: It looks like he passed this way. The way he moved,\nthough... It was inhuman.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_B04_m01: <BLN>Are you alright?!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B06_m01_002: I heard a strange voice, and right after that an\nawful-looking man rushed past. I nearly fainted.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B06_m01_003: Luckily, he didn't seem to notice us and headed\ntoward Temple Row.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_B06_m01: <BLN>What an awful man...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B07_m01_001: If it's a big wounded guy you're looking for, I saw\nhim running toward the temples.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_B07_m01: <BLN>Did something happen?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B08_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B08_m01_001: The Trafalgar's repairs have been completed. Very\nsorry for the wait.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c06_B08_m01_003: Your ship is ready to set sail again.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c06_B08_m01: <BLN>A report!